\\ map_macros.6502 - the map's macros: getting round a cell's ring.

\\ The next side clockwise round a cell's ring (pt_map_ring_next): the one after, or after the last,
\\ the first.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     Y: the side
\\     X: its cell
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     Y: the next side
\\     A: corrupted
\\     X: preserved

MACRO RING_NEXT
    INY
    TYA:CMP cell_first+1,X:BNE done     ; the next cell's first: past the ring's end
    LDY cell_first,X                    ; round to its first
.done
ENDMACRO
